window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_REBORN_BOOT_CAMP_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":5501,"title":"Chapter 5501: No Fate","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan felt helpless about his girlfriend’s honesty and sighed, \"If Third Brother knew you ignored everyone else, it would break his heart.\"","\"I won’t let Third Brother find out.\" Ye Jian smiled and winked, \"If I don’t say anything and you don’t say anything, Third Brother will never know. Speaking of which, is Third Brother also coming home for the Spring Festival this year?\"","\"I’m not sure, all I need to know is that my future father-in-law is coming back. Before you came down today, you talked to Old Man Xia about us extending our vacation and asked if my future father-in-law would come back for the Spring Festival this year. Old Man Xia then called to ask, and it was a security guard who answered, telling him that my future father-in-law would be on leave. At that moment, I felt like God was on my side.\"","Xia Jinyuan decided not to keep her in suspense, and seeing Ye Jian’s immediate relief, he glared at her with a mix of annoyance and amusement, \"Are you really that afraid of me bringing up the engagement to my future father-in-law?\"","Without disguising her feelings, Ye Jian nodded in reply, \"I am a bit afraid. You know my father plans to keep me at home until I’m twenty-seven or twenty-eight. If you suddenly bring up engagement, I genuinely worry my father will whip you with a belt.\"","\"As long as my future father-in-law agrees, I’d be willing to be whipped ten times.\" Taking advantage of the red light, Xia Jinyuan reached over and ruffled Ye Jian’s hair, \"Baby, I really can’t wait to marry you now.\"","\"If you have the chance, you would definitely discuss it with my father in advance.\" Ye Jian was certain of this, because the man beside her never picked a battle he couldn’t win.","\"Of course, I would ask my future father-in-law in advance, I wouldn’t overstep anyone, especially not my future father-in-law.\" Xia Jinyuan had never thought to play any tricks in front of his future father-in-law, because, he was very aware, that any slight scheming on his part would lead to unbearable consequences.","For example... if they could get engaged after another four or five years, that would also be fine!","Xia Jinyuan had a deep understanding of how formidable his future father-in-law could be. A soft knife that slowly cuts, grinding you down until you’re quaking in fear, and then, with a smile, he would sheathe the knife and say, \"Just kidding,\" leaving you so scared you nearly wet yourself, all the while maintaining his refined and graceful demeanor.","Such prowess was truly fearsome.","Seeing the remnants of trepidation on his face, Ye Jian, sitting in the passenger seat with one hand supporting her forehead, laughed until she couldn’t contain herself.","They left in the morning and returned at nightfall, driving up the mountain road that wound through the silence, surrounded by a vast expanse of white snow. In the expensive capital city, Dan Gui Garden felt like a paradise.","The entire Dan Gui Garden was exceptional in its stillness. Passing several villas, each household was quiet, with red lanterns hanging outside their doors, casting a festive glow that faintly diminished the night’s austerity.","A car approached from the front, and as the two vehicles passed side by side, Xia Jinyuan, focused on driving and talking to Ye Jian, did not notice who the other driver was.","Qin Xiu, however, saw Xia Jinyuan in the light of the headlights, slowing down his speed also let him see Ye Jian in the passenger seat, smiling like a blossoming flower.","Qin Xiu’s hands tightened on the steering wheel, recalling what Qin Ying had said during the day, he let out a barely audible sigh within the car, filled with a bitter taste.","As his sister had said, if it’s not meant to be, it’s not meant to be, harboring it in one’s heart is futile.","The cars passed each other, driving off in opposite directions, just like Qin Xiu and Ye Jian, destined to be an unrequited love on Qin Xiu’s part, never to bear fruit.","\"It’s getting late now, I won’t go in and disturb Grandpa Gen. You should rest early.\" Xia Jinyuan kissed Ye Jian’s forehead and then pecked her lips firmly."]},{"number":5502,"title":"Chapter 5502: Waiting","paragraphs":["Ye Jian’s face blushed unseen in the dark night, but she did not dodge anymore, until Xia Jinyuan let her go, \"Be careful when driving on the road, don’t drive too fast.\"","\"Mm, I’ll come over to pick you up tomorrow morning.\" Xia Jinyuan smiled again as he kissed Ye Jian’s forehead, reluctant to leave, \"Rest early, goodnight.\"","\"Mm, you should also rest early, goodnight.\" Ye Jian, with her hand covering her flushed face to cool it down, carried the bags inside the door, while Xia Jinyuan stood behind her until she entered the family home.","When Ye Jian returned home, she saw the dim lights in the living room. She initially thought the Old Man Xia had already gone to sleep, but unexpectedly, Old Man Xia was still sitting in the living room watching TV.","Ordinarily, Old Man Xia would go to bed at nine in the evening. It was just a bit past nine now. Uncle Fu had urged him once, but Old Man Xia said he wanted to wait for Ye Jian to come back, so Uncle Fu stopped urging and stayed to wait with him.","Seeing Ye Jian return, Uncle Fu immediately stood up from the sofa, \"You’re back, eh? Are you tired?\"","At home, Uncle Fu was always like an elder to Ye Jian, gentle and kind, always caring for her.","Old Man Xia smiled even more kindly, \"Our princess is back. Come, let Grandpa see what you’ve gathered today.\" Anticipating her return, Old Man Xia was happy to wait.","Ye Jian didn’t expect that Old Man Xia and Uncle Fu were both still awake, and she was immediately filled with guilt. She dropped her bags to the floor and sat down next to Old Man Xia, embracing his arms, \"Grandpa, my apologies for making you wait, I will make sure to come back earlier next time.\"","It was past nine and they hadn’t slept, surely because they were worried about her and were waiting.","\"I haven’t waited long, haven’t waited long, I just wanted to see what you’ve got today.\" Old Man Xia observed Ye Jian wearing clothes completely different from when she left, nodding with a smile, \"New clothes, did Little Six pick them out for you? He has good taste, they look nice.\"","Ye Jian pointed at the handbags on the floor, moving closer to Old Man Xia and spoke teasingly, \"Grandpa, when do I not look good? Look, all bought by him, I didn’t even want to buy them, and he was not happy about it.\"","Making her boyfriend look good, it couldn’t be helped, they were getting engaged after all.","It was surely necessary to give Grandpa some peace of mind.","\"Yes, that’s true, our Fu family’s granddaughter looks beautiful in anything.\" Old Man Xia agreed wholeheartedly with Ye Jian’s self-praise. In his eyes, his granddaughter was the best girl, incomparable to anyone, \"Why didn’t Little Six come in for a cup of tea before leaving? It’s late in the night, it shouldn’t be a problem, we have guest rooms at home.\"","He wasn’t an outsider, he was definitely going to be the grandson-in-law, staying over for one night at home wouldn’t be an issue.","\"We all thought Grandpa had already gone to sleep, so he didn’t dare to come in and disturb,\" Ye Jian softly said, \"Tomorrow he will come to our home and play chess with Grandpa.\"","\"Little Six is thoughtful, that’s good, the way he takes care of you, Grandpa is also very reassured. It’s getting late, and you must be tired too, go and rest early,\" Old Man Xia slowly stood up, \"Tomorrow Little Six will come over, he will surely take you out again.\"","Ye Jian helped Old Man Xia to stand, \"Tomorrow we might go to the horse track, but it’s not decided yet, if we go to the horse track, would you like to come with us, Grandpa?\"","\"Hahaha, silly girl, you two go out and have fun, I’m just an old man, why join the fun? If you go to the horse track tomorrow, have a good time. It’s rare to get a rest day, and it’s during New Year’s too, you must have fun, that’s the proper way.\"","The old master certainly didn’t want to follow; the young folks had their way of having fun. If he went along, he might spoil their fun."]},{"number":5503,"title":"Chapter 5503: Guard","paragraphs":["Ye Jian couldn’t accept that, \"Grandpa Xia, Grandma Xia are going, how can you not go?\"","\"That’s just to humor you two. At my age, going to the horse farm, I can’t ride, and I’d just be a burden on you kids to accompany me. I won’t enjoy it, so I won’t go, I won’t go.\" Old Man Xia was skeptical; he knew the couple too well.","\"If Grandpa Xia and Grandma Xia really go, then you must go too. Xia Yunyin’s horse farm is warm; there’s a chess room and a tea room. You can sit inside and watch us ride from the big French windows. Next door, there’s a pattern shooting range, also Xia Yunyin’s place; you could play there for a day.\"","Other old masters might not be tempted, but the idea of seeing his granddaughter ride a horse was very exciting for him, so he asked, \"And the shooting range? Can I see that?\"","\"Yes, yes, yes.\" Ye Jian hurriedly assured, \"You can see everything from inside.\"","The old master was thoroughly convinced, \"Sounds like a nice place. That Xia family’s fifth brother is pretty capable, finding such a place. If the Xia couple goes, then grandpa will join them too.\"","\"But let me make it clear beforehand, you play your games, but please don’t just stay inside because grandpa is there, neglecting to play.\"","\"Okay, I’ll definitely not just stick around, I’ll make sure to have fun. Let me take you back to your room, and we can confirm tomorrow whether we’ll go or not.\" Ye Jian, smiling, helped Old Man Xia back to his room. Seeing her happy made him happy too.","His granddaughter was so thoughtful!","After escorting Old Man Xia back to his room, and having finished washing up, Ye Jian lay in bed with no trace of sleepiness, her mind filled with Xia Jinyuan’s words about their engagement.","The thought always made her nervous; not that she was unwilling to confirm her relationship with Xia Jinyuan. Of course not, she was willing, and they had already met each other’s parents. It was really just a matter of having an engagement ceremony in front of both families and holding a wedding.","She understood very clearly that in this world, she couldn’t find anyone more suitable for her than Xia Jinyuan. Given a second chance at life, this man had become an inseparable part of her world, and she was well aware of his feelings for her.","From acquaintance to love, they had spent so many years together, and it was time to settle down, first getting engaged, then married; step by step, it was actually quite nice.","The Xia family was a hundred percent supportive; the only worry was her own family. Grandpa was easy to talk to, but her father would take some effort. However, Captain Xia said he’d handle it.","Alright, she would let him handle it first. If he couldn’t, she would step in. This would also show Captain Xia’s sincerity, letting her father see his true intention to be with her for a lifetime.","Thinking about it, Ye Jian’s heart settled again.","Her cellphone on the nightstand suddenly rang. Ye Jian immediately got up from the bed, grabbed the phone quickly.","It was a message from Xia Jinyuan, letting her know he had gotten home safely.","Ye Jian returned the message with a smile, \"Okay, get some rest early, see you tomorrow.\" After replying, she hugged the phone and laughed, no different from any other girl with a crush.","Xia Jinyuan, who had just returned to the Xia family’s old residence, was also in a good mood replying, \"Hmm, see you tomorrow. Sweet dreams.\"","\"Tsk tsk tsk, seeing this, one can tell you had a fulfilling day.\" Xia Yunyin, who had been waiting for him to return, approached with a smile, \"What do you think, isn’t the idea your fifth brother gave quite good?\""]},{"number":5504,"title":"Chapter 5504: Making Trouble","paragraphs":["Xia Jinyuan put away his phone, and even the tenderness at the corners of his eyes completely dissipated. He glanced indifferently at Xia Yunyin, who became visibly uneasy, \"What... what kind of expression is that? Don’t tell me, you had a fight? No, that’s not right; the way you were just now, like you’re on an aphrodisiac, it didn’t seem like a fight at all.\"","\"Little Six, today I was severely lectured by grandma, so don’t you scare me. I’m faint-hearted and can’t take fright!\"","This concerned Little Six’s lifelong happiness and the pressure on him as an elder brother was immense. He was terrified of inadvertently ruining Little Six’s chance at a happy marriage.","After a long while, Xia Jinyuan finally let out a cold \"Hmph,\" \"Fifth brother, keep those ideas to yourself and your girlfriend. Who tries, who knows.\"","\"How are things at the horse ranch? Are we still going tomorrow?\"","His Little Fox liked horse riding and shooting; as for shopping, she really had no interest in it.","Upon hearing that nothing was amiss, Xia Yunyin instantly felt a sense of relief, as if he had eaten a heart-calming pill, \"The day after tomorrow, let’s go the day after tomorrow. Tomorrow I will have someone tidy up the horse ranch well and straighten out the shooting range thoroughly, and we will go over again the day after.\"","\"I’ll also invite some friends, all from the social circles of the capital city. It’s good for you and your sister-in-law to meet and get to know them.\"","Just as Xia Jinyuan was about to agree, he suddenly became vigilant, \"Is there a reason for this?\"","A family outing wouldn’t cause the fifth brother to invite friends from his circle in the capital city for no reason. The friends from the capital city weren’t ordinary friends; each one was either rich or noble.","\"This afternoon, I had two friends call me, saying their mothers had just been inquiring about the Xia family, especially mentioning Little Six. My friends were alert and probed further, and, lo and behold, they found out that my former aunt has been out playing the victim again.\"","\"Now, most of the ladies in the circle know Little Six as the scoundrel who disowns his biological mother. I tell you, Little Six, that mother of yours really can’t stay out of trouble. She schemed against me a few years back, and when that failed, she kept quiet for a while only to stir up trouble again. Your days, I’m afraid, won’t be too peaceful.\"","With a mother holding you back, how can your days be peaceful?","On hearing this, a fierce rage filled Xia Jinyuan’s eyes, darker than the night itself, but soon he regained his composure, \"There’s more to this. Madam Xiao is now trying to recognize me; she wouldn’t do anything that would put her at a disadvantage.\"","\"Are you saying someone is taking this opportunity to make trouble?\" A chill came over Xia Yunyin’s handsome face, and the once cheerful man suddenly revealed a ruthless side only seen in the business world, \"I’ll investigate. Once I find out, I’ll take good care of them.\"","\"Fifth brother, there’s no need to investigate. I’ll meet with your friends tomorrow and see, oh, and do any of your friends happen to be married? If so, please invite their wives over as well.\"","Xia Jinyuan didn’t want to drag Xia Yunyin into the mess. He already had an idea of who was behind the trouble.","\"You have a lead? Can you handle it yourself?\" Xia Yunyin sensed what was left unsaid, feeling somewhat reassured.","\"Mm, one who is not very easy to deal with, but also poses no significant threat. The waters are somewhat deep, and as a businessman, you are not suited to get involved.\"","Xia Jinyuan hinted just enough.","\"Alright, as long as you’re confident.\" The hint was enough for Xia Yunyin to understand that the matter was beyond his means to solve. He was capable, but it wasn’t appropriate for him to step in.","As for what Xia Jinyuan requested, Xia Yunyin could guarantee with assurance. In the capital city, what he had the most was friends: those related to business, mere acquaintances, a few genuine ones, and several who had grown up together and were now successful in their own right. Xia Jinyuan could bring as many friends as he wished to the gathering; Xia Yunyin could arrange that many friends to attend."]}]);
